\ designs/smallest/genes.4 - smallest's genes for forth/cross-cv8.4, written by lab/evolve/export-genes.py from the
\ options the evolver hands the translator (tools/layout.py) and the engine's flags. Include it before
\ cross-cv8.4: S" extend.4" INCLUDED  S" genes.4" INCLUDED  S" cross-cv8.4" INCLUDED
: G-OVERLAYS ( --- c-addr u ) S" cv8.4 cv8b.4 cv8b-kfast.4 file-sysc.4 file-sysc2.4 file-sysc3.4 " ;          \ after kernel.4, in this order
: G-FOLDS ( --- c-addr u ) S" + @ RSHIFT C! XOR LIT AND DROP OR ! DUP " ;     \ the fold set: FOLD-BASE + place
0 CONSTANT G-SPEC          \ the specialisations: 1 small, 2 imm, 4 var, 8 tiny, 16 loc
: G-SUPERS ( --- c-addr u ) S" SWAP R> 92 " ;    \ fused pairs: first second opcode
: G-OPS10 ( --- c-addr u ) S" ?BRANCH8 126 BRANCH8 127 0<?BRANCH 84 I 85 UNLOOP 86 FILL 87 CMOVE 88 2@ 89 0= 90 0<?BRANCH8 91 " ;     \ format-10 operations: name opcode
32 CONSTANT G-HOTCALLS      \ one-byte calls, at most
-1 CONSTANT G-OP-BODIES     \ the format-10 words' bodies their opcode
-1 CONSTANT G-OP-INLINE     \ ...placed among the primitives
-1 CONSTANT G-BSS           \ TIB, POCKET, INCLUDE-BUFFER past the image's end
-1 CONSTANT G-THIN-HEADER   \ one empty thread head in the file
16 CONSTANT G-THREADS       \ the dictionary's hash threads
: G-REBIND ( --- c-addr u ) S" OPEN-FILE CLOSE-FILE WRITE-FILE ALLOCATE FREE WRITE READ READ-LINE BYE " ;    \ the kernel's uses rebound to the overlays' words
: G-HEADERLESS ( --- c-addr u ) S" FS-BLK FS0 FS1 FS2 FS3 FS4 FS-DROP FS-WRITE FS-NL FS-MMAP FS-OFL FS-END FS-SAVED FS-P FS-EDIT? FS-SEEKS? FS-BACK FS-UPTO-EDIT FS-ANY FS-LF FS-CR FS-SK FS-BIT FS-FORGET " ;
0 CONSTANT G-ENGINE-SPEC   \ the engine's flags: SPEC (the locals block in the header)
59 CONSTANT G-FEATURES      \ the image's feature bits (engine/vm-lab.c's IMAGE_MAGIC)
0 CONSTANT G-MAGIC5
